senses.gloss:
--the form of the Lord during the period of creation, just emerged from अण्ड.
1: भा. II. 1. २५; III. 6. 6-३४; 7. २२-25; २६. ५१.
To rouse him to activity gods were created; but he was not roused until the क्षेत्रज्ञ along with citta entered the heart and roused the पुरुष from waters;
2: Ib. III. ३६. ५४-70; X. 3. १५; XI. 3. ११-12; १७. १३.
is Hari who is described as महा- पुरुष;
3: Ib. XII. ११. 5-२६.
son of Nara;
4: Br. II. १४. ६८.
अन्तरिक्ष so called.
5: Ib. II. १६. १७; III. ४३. 9.
